# brain-stem: managed secret-exclusions
# Seeded into $CLAUDE_HOME/.gitignore by install.sh at install time.
# Deny-list-at-the-VCS-boundary: these surfaces NEVER enter the
# git index, so the backup wrapper (skills/librarian/capabilities/backup.sh)
# cannot exfiltrate them to a remote. Belt-and-suspenders with the staged-
# diff token scanner.
#
# Secret-bearing surfaces:
settings.local.json
.pre-uninstall-*/
projects/
#
# Runtime state + always-noise:
hooks/state/
*.key
*.pem
*.registry
sk-ant-*
.DS_Store
